      "writtenOn": "2024-07-03T18:55:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yea, so we already have something similar to this via `Pipeline.h` and `RenderPipeline.h`: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/RenderPipeline.cpp;l\u003d1251;drc\u003d67d0441446c6264c2921cf5c41098e6b4db467d3;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1\n\nLooks like we re-record the has with the parent classes hash.",
      "parentUuid": "4bb4f0ae_be5340ee",
      "revId": "c05511d32e9bfef07edf59c8a3bd510a4a0ae101",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
